stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Starting
  Starting --> InteractiveReady
  InteractiveReady --> AwaitingInput
  AwaitingInput --> RunningTurn: prompt injected / human input
  RunningTurn --> RunningCommand: agent runs tool/command
  RunningCommand --> AwaitingApproval: approval requested
  AwaitingApproval --> RunningCommand: approved
  AwaitingApproval --> NeedsHuman: rejected or unknown
  RunningCommand --> CompletedTurn: AGENTMUX_RESULT
  RunningTurn --> CompletedTurn: AGENTMUX_RESULT
  CompletedTurn --> AwaitingInput
  AwaitingInput --> Stalled: timeout uncertain
  RunningTurn --> Stalled: no activity
  Stalled --> AwaitingInput: status probe response
  Stalled --> NeedsHuman: no response
  NeedsHuman --> AwaitingInput: human resolved
  Starting --> Failed
  RunningTurn --> Failed
  RunningCommand --> Failed
  AwaitingInput --> Exited
  RunningTurn --> Exited
  Exited --> [*]
  Failed --> [*]
